<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33482" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pallesco</span></b> , pallăi, 3,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. inch.
			n.</i> [palleo], <i>to grow</i> or <i>turn pale.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: ut qui timent 
			 sanguine ex ore decedente pallescant, <i><span class="en">Gell. 19,
				4, 4</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pallescere curis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
					1, 13, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nullā pallescere culpā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 1, 61</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pallescet super his,</span>”
				<i>will turn pale with emotion</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. A.
					P. 429</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">umbraticā vitā pallescere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 1, 2, 18</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">12, 10,
			76</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>to turn pale</i>,
				<i>sallow</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pallescunt frondes,</span>”
				<i>wither</i>, <i>fade</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. A.
					A. 3, 704</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">viso pallescit flamma veneno,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 7, 586</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 9, 17, 30, § 66</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
